{"id":"8763ccf377783f45","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-J.md","title":"Ideal J","display":"df-J — Ideal J","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-J","aliases":["58-df-J"],"display":"df-J — Ideal J","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-J"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-J</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-J — Ideal J"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(J\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(J,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(J,A)\\)</span>（本文件定义的真集合理想）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}J} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ideal}_S(J,A)\\leftrightarrow\\left(J\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\land\\emptyset\\in J\\land A\\notin J\\land\\forall Y\\in J\\;\\forall X\\subseteq Y\\;(X\\in J)\\land\\forall X,Y\\in J\\;(X\\cup Y\\in J)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}J} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ideal}_S(J,A)\\leftrightarrow\\left(J\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\land\\emptyset\\in J\\land A\\notin J\\land\\forall Y\\in J\\;\\forall X\\subseteq Y\\;(X\\in J)\\land\\forall X,Y\\in J\\;(X\\cup Y\\in J)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This preserves the uppercase <code>J</code> target used by existing atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in V$（see [[../batch12/58-df-set.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)$（see [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"J\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}_S(J,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}J} \\vdash \\mathrm{Id